  "description": "Microsoft Agent Framework agents over TechieRag: a fluent TechieRagAgentBuilder (LM Studio first, Ollama, OpenAI, OpenAI-compatible, or the LLM already configured on TechieRag), agentic retrieval tools with citation refs and match-quality status, and public adapters between TechieRag's ILlmProvider, IToolHandler, IProgress<AgentStep> and IConversationMemory seams and Microsoft.Extensions.AI / Agent Framework. No hosted tools, no telemetry exporters: nothing leaves the machine except calls to the model you configure.",
